"P968420960" "Aha!  I see what to do now."

// REPAIR_CREY_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2762144688" "You picked a bad time to interrupt my work."
// REPAIR_CREY_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2653179161" "How dare you!"
// REPAIR_CREY_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1613095796" "How rude!"
// REPAIR_CREY_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P289984899" "Neutralize the hero threat!"
// REPAIR_CREY_ACTIVE_TEXT :
