// REPAIR_CREY_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3581094616" "No doubt trying to steal our technology!"

// RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P423082363" "I'm ready to break some noses."
// RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2169685475" "Let's get this rumble going."
// RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1614192140" "I've been itching for this all day."

