// HARRASS_HARRASSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4254942231" "You want me to rearrange your face?"
// HARRASS_HARRASSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2992690282" "You looking to get beat?"
// HARRASS_HARRASSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1501629086" "Someone needs to learn about respect."
// HARRASS_HARRASSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P463773472" "Chaos, panic, disorder.  My work here is done."
// HARRASS_HARRASSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1260623191" "Beauty is in the eye of the beholder, and it may be necessary, from time to time, to give a stupid or misinformed beholder a black eye."
// HARRASS_HARRASSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P656605690" "I can be one of those bad things that happens to bad people.   Or even good people."

// HARRASS_HARRASSER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2990620966" "You heroes are always interfering."
// HARRASS_HARRASSER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P662500758" "This is private!  Mind your own business!"
// HARRASS_HARRASSER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P328838508" "So.  You want to be first?"

// HARRASS_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1367472308" "You'll pay for this assault."
// HARRASS_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1612279184" "You'll be a marked man."
// HARRASS_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1319748943" "You goons are no match for my buddies."

// HARRASS_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P594104853" "Heh.  What a scared little bunny!"
// HARRASS_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1348014284" "You're not so tough without your friends."
// HARRASS_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1580251100" "We're going to make you an example."

// HARRASS_VICTIM_VILLAIN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2315620445" "I don't need your help!"
// HARRASS_VICTIM_VILLAIN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P151724353" "Don't think this makes us friends!"
// HARRASS_VICTIM_VILLAIN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1229110650" "How dare you?  I would have won easily!"

// GUARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3944859786" "You won't get past me!"
// GUARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3954297695" "You think you can invade Crey territory?"
// GUARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1556880917" "You'll be sorry you showed up on my watch."
// GUARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2828101892" "Warning:  Trespassers will be shot.  Survivors will be shot again."

