// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1229875911" "You do NOT have authorization!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4254819329" "You're not on the personnel list!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P911695174" "Oh, I don't THINK so!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BASEGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2662493038" "This is simple:  any of those Vanguard or lackeys get through, I take your head off."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BASEGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2070174316" "Pretend like your life depends keeping Vanguard or any of its lackeys out this base.  Because it does."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BASEGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P555492270" "I have no patience for disobedience.  You wanna be a free thinker?  Join a philosophy class."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BASEGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3336819077" "Move it!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BASEGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3019564000" "You know what to do!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BASEGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4002363987" "Think this is a game?!  You lose!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1808803843" "One way or another, Crey Industries will find a way to make this war zone profitable.  That's why this corporation is so great."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3858044920" "Vanguard doesn't scare me.  I don't care if they're cloaked in Impervium or fairy petals.  I'll still find a way to take 'em down."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1177773082" "You think we can sway a few of those lackeys from the Rogue Isles to our way?  I can see an opportunity for subversion here."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P608017336" "I was RIGHT in the middle of a story.  Now I gotta hurt you."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1764296728" "Some days, suckers like you make my job worthwhile."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2023361559" "Wrap it up!  Let's get to work!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P489011492" "Move forward.  Shoot anything that moves.  Simple."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2102833055" "Let's go.  We have a long day ahead of us."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2929141425" "Follow me."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1301934583" "Tactical fire break!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2255922489" "Pincushion time!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3120432230" "Let's go!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3049556393" "Looks good.  Ready for use?"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P543382383" "Ammo check, I do not want slip ups because someone forgot to replace their ammo!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3865446819" "Good job."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P297138413" "Incoming!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P139086465" "How'd you get in here!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P478935984" "You have no authorization here!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BASERESEARCH_LAPTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P405916084" "This is a virtual gold mine.  Between the Vanguard technology and the Rikti?  We are SET."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BASERESEARCH_LAPTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1754748777" "Hang on, I'm entering the data now."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BASERESEARCH_LAPTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2057525463" "Just a few more keystrokes and I think I got it.  Okay go."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BASERESEARCH_LAPTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3870630420" "Well a laptop in a war zone isn't exactly my idea of ideal working conditions, but it's what I got.  So gimme a minute and I'll send the data."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BASERESEARCH_SECURITY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1904671543" "Breach!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BASERESEARCH_SECURITY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P424995296" "Unauthorized access!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BASERESEARCH_SECURITY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3054193808" "Do NOT let them get the data!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2357434115" "TODO: Add Text"


// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_RECRUIT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3788574767" "It's a shame society has singled you out. Join us at Crey Industries and be rewarded for your ingenuity."
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_RECRUIT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2412193115" "We at Crey Industries have just the opportunity for capable hands such as yours."
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_RECRUIT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2760567258" "We at Crey Industries need capable minds such as yours to help us meet the ever growing demand of our discerning clientele."
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_RECRUIT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1440862864" "We at Crey Industries supply the world's wealthiest regimes with cutting edge weapons and technology."

// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_RECRUIT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P484246451" "Behold, boys! Our patented Power Tank can cut any hero down to size!"
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_RECRUIT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3479303699" "Power Tank, show these boys what you're capable of!"
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_RECRUIT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2250529428" "Alright, soldier. Time to shine!"

// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_BRIEFCASE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1498884255" "It's highly unusual for them to be late like this."
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_BRIEFCASE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2556306673" "Something is wrong. They have never been late before."

// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_CHAT_AGENT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3399518172" "You really screwed the pooch on this one..."
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_CHAT_AGENT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2546290698" "Do you realise the amount of crap this puts us in?"
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_CHAT_AGENT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2521748930" "We had everything riding on this going smoothly."
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_CHAT_AGENT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2289372799" "Crey is not taking the fall for this. Your mess-up, your clean-up!"

// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_CHAT_RIOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4161020140" "No one needs to know."
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_CHAT_RIOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3553884842" "No one saw it happen. It can be like they never existed."

// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_YELLING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2224458038" "Those orders came from the top! We are trying to set a new precident for ourselves here!"
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_YELLING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3886409740" "No more cracking innocent skulls out there. We are trying to protect our image."
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_YELLING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P44677797" "If we'd known you couldn't follow simple instructions, we would have let you all rot in prison!"

// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_SCI_PONDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3593333698" "No... something's not right with this unit."
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_SCI_PONDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2797825380" "I'll be the judge of that."
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_SCI_PONDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3640863010" "Mmm, of course. But its not the armor I'm worried about..."

// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_TANK_ATTN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3971464086" "Armor is in working order, doctor."
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_TANK_ATTN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4128314030" "The armor is holding up well."
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_TANK_ATTN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3914928041" "Nothing new to report on the armor."

// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_SCI_OBSERVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2288320389" "Six Million dollars down the drain... What a waste."
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_SCI_OBSERVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3515968567" "Do what you can I suppose, although I don't really see the point."
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_SCI_OBSERVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1022098138" "We are over budget as it is. Any further repairs must be made on the field."
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_SCI_OBSERVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P566681010" "Looks like we might have to scrap this one. Such a shame."


// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_SCI_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P251670476" "No data is bad data I suppose."
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_SCI_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3889963093" "Nothing is adding up, I just don't understand."
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_SCI_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2469058166" "I've seen this before. If it's anything like that time we'll be here all night."

// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_SCI_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P835644207" "We have been comprimised!"

// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_TANK_ATTN_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P668292997" "I will prove to you that I am as capable as ever!"
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_TANK_ATTN_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1931873663" "I will crush this hero and then you'll see!"

// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_RIOT_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3758841786" "Just so we're clear. You didn't SEE anything, right?"
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_RIOT_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P554589425" "So if anyone asks, what do you say? WELL!?"
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_RIOT_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2329273325" "Shut up and quit crying! Now I'll ask you again. What did you see?"
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_RIOT_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1662833393" "It'd be a shame if your family went missing just because you couln't keep your stupid trap shut."
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_RIOT_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3046650447" "Don't even think about blabbing about this to the law. It's not like they can't protect you anyway."

// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_RIOT_THREATEN_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2697444073" "Goodbye."
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_RIOT_THREATEN_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P387380354" "That's does it."
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_RIOT_THREATEN_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2001371944" "Forget it."
// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_RIOT_THREATEN_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1025519908" "I'm done with you."


// BRICKSTOWN_CREY_YELLING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1377754645" "We have been compromised!"

// BRICKSTOWN_VICTIM_DEATH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3201120844" "NO!"
// BRICKSTOWN_VICTIM_DEATH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
